# Repository information

Current latest stable GW kernel version is v6.12-venice. The v6.12-venice-itn is NOFFZ custom modifications, which apply to all the ITN versions. All other versions that originates from v6.12-venice-itn are separate custom configs for specific goals. 

There is a separate versioning system for our kernel versions, to keep track of all the previous states.

# Build and install kernel

https://trac.gateworks.com/wiki/linux/kernel

## Change log
- 6.6.31-vanilla 
  - default mainline 6.6.31
- 6.6.31-1.0.1
  - 6.6.31 with 599a28fa9ecd98f7c2937e4215a7788403d1cfd6 backport
- 6.6.35-vanilla
  - default mainline 6.6.35 

## Checkout linux stable
```
git clone git://git.kernel.org/pub/scm/linux/kernel/git/stable/linux.git
cd linux
git checkout <version eg.: v6.6.31>
```

## Clean repo if needed
```
git reset --hard HEAD
git clean -fdx
```

## Cherry pick if needed
THis is the fix for BT-SIG test  
From 6.6.35 we need 599a28fa9ecd98f7c2937e4215a7788403d1cfd6 commit.  
Bluetooth: L2CAP: Fix rejecting L2CAP_CONN_PARAM_UPDATE_REQ

## Install stuff
```
apt install build-essential ncurses-dev bc u-boot-tools liblzo2-dev lzop git bison flex openssl libssl-dev gcc-aarch64-linux-gnu
```

## Set env variables
```
export ARCH=arm64
export CROSS_COMPILE=aarch64-linux-gnu-
export INSTALL_PATH=install
export INSTALL_MOD_STRIP=1
export LOADADDR=0x40200000
```

## Clear config
```
make distclean
```

## Config for GW board
```
wget -O arch/x86/configs/imx8m_venice_defconfig https://github.com/Gateworks/linux-venice/blob/v6.6.8-venice-mm6108/arch/arm64/configs/imx8m_venice_defconfig
make imx8m_venice_defconfig
```

## Manual config
```
make menuconfig
```
- Netwokring support
  - Wireless
    - Onuc sfg
- Device drivers
  - Network device support
    - Wireless LAN
      - Atheros dynamic user regularotry
      - Atheros dynamic user regulatory testing
      - Qualcomm Technologies 802.11ax (legyen bekapcsolva)

## Build kernel
```
make -j$(nproc) Image modules dtbs
```

## Set up stuff
```
mkdir -p $INSTALL_PATH/boot
make modules_install INSTALL_MOD_PATH=$INSTALL_PATH # install modules
make headers_install INSTALL_HDR_PATH=$INSTALL_PATH/usr # install headers
cp arch/arm64/boot/Image arch/arm64/boot/dts/freescale/imx8*venice*.dtb* $INSTALL_PATH/boot # install kernel and dtbs
gzip -fk $INSTALL_PATH/boot/Image
mkimage -f auto -A $ARCH -O linux -T kernel -C gzip -n "Kernel" \
  -a $LOADADDR -e $LOADADDR -d $INSTALL_PATH/boot/Image.gz $INSTALL_PATH/boot/kernel.itb # FIT image
wget https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Gateworks/bsp-venice/master/boot.scr -O boot.scr
mkimage -A $ARCH -T script -C none -d boot.scr $INSTALL_PATH/boot/boot.scr # boot script
```
## Export kernel to img
```
tar -C $INSTALL_PATH --owner=0 --group=0 -cvJf linux.tar.xz .
```

## install
```
tar -C / -xvf linux.tar.xz --keep-directory-symlink
```

